ontract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-of-course-rule\">df-of-course-rule</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}:=R_!.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}:=R_!.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}=\\left\\{\\frac{\\vdash?\\Gamma,A}{\\vdash?\\Gamma,!A}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}=\\left\\{\\frac{\\vdash?\\Gamma,A}{\\vdash?\\Gamma,!A}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则是有前提序列与结论的有序对集合，非一个没有定义的可导性谓词。片段语法由有限构造迭代给出；指数节点指完整命题LL中!/?规则层，不把一般结构规则加回非指数公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-of-course-rule","text":"df-of-course-rule","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}:=R_!.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{OfCourseRule}=\\left\\{\\frac{\\vdash?\\Gamma,A}{\\vdash?\\Gamma,!A}\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1239,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-of-course-rule|df-of-course-rule — Of Course Rule]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-of-course-rule|df-of-course-rule — Of Course Rule]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-of-course-rule|72-df-of-course-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}